---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Checkout cancelled | ByteLite LLC"
  description="This ByteLite LLC checkout was not completed and nothing was created."
  keywords="ByteLite checkout cancelled"
  canonical="https://www.thebytelite.com/checkout/cancel/"
  noindex={true}
>
  <Header slot="header" />

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Checkout</p>
      <h1>Nothing happened.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        You left checkout before it completed. No payment was taken, no payment method was stored,
        no subscription was created and no reservation was recorded. There is nothing to cancel and
        nothing to refund.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="body">
        If you meant to complete it, you can start again from founder access. If something on the
        way through was unclear or broken, I would rather hear about it than have you assume it was
        you.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a href="/founder-access" class="btn btn-primary">Back to founder access</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline">Tell me what went wrong</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Layout>

<style>
.narrow { max-width: 780px; }
.page-hero { padding: 3.5rem 0 2rem; }
.hero-sub { max-width: 640px; font-size: 1.0625rem; margin-top: 1rem; color: #a0a8c0; line-height: 1.8; }
.body { font-size: 1rem; color: #a0a8c0; line-height: 1.8; }
.cta-row { display: flex; gap: .75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 2rem; }
</style>
